<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title><%= locals.brand || 'Leadflow' %> – Lead automation</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:wght@500;700;800&family=Instrument+Sans:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #eef2f0;
      --panel: #ffffff;
      --ink: #14211f;
      --muted: #56665f;
      --line: #d0dad6;
      --teal: #0f4c4a;
      --teal-deep: #0a3533;
      --mint: #bfe3d6;
      --amber: #f2b134;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: "Instrument Sans", system-ui, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--ink);
      line-height: 1.55;
    }
    h1, h2, h3 { font-family: "Bricolage Grotesque", "Instrument Sans", sans-serif; margin: 0; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
    a { color: inherit; }
    .container { max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }

    /* Nav */
    nav { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 22px 0; }
    .logo { font-family: "Bricolage Grotesque", sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.3rem; text-decoration: none; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
    .logo i { width: 14px; height: 14px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--amber); box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px var(--mint); display: inline-block; }
    .links { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 28px; font-weight: 500; }
    .links a { text-decoration: none; color: var(--muted); }
    .links a:hover { color: var(--ink); }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600;
      padding: 13px 24px; border-radius: 999px;
      transition: transform .15s, background .15s;
    }
    .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .btn:focus-visible, .links a:focus-visible, .logo:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--amber); outline-offset: 3px; }
    .btn-primary { background: var(--teal); color: #fff; }
    .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--teal-deep); }
    .btn-ghost { border: 1.5px solid var(--ink); color: var(--ink); }

    /* Hero */
    .hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.05fr; gap: 56px; align-items: center; padding: 56px 0 88px; }
    .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 5.4vw, 4.4rem); line-height: 1.02; font-weight: 800; max-width: 12ch; }
    .hero p { font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--muted); max-width: 42ch; margin: 24px 0 36px; }
    .actions { display: flex; gap: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }

    /* Pipeline board */
    .board { background: var(--teal); border-radius: 24px; padding: 22px; position: relative; box-shadow: 0 30px 60px -30px rgba(15, 76, 74, .6); }
    .cols { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 14px; }
    .col { background: rgba(255,255,255,.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 14px 12px; min-height: 270px; }
    .col h3 { color: var(--mint); font-size: .95rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 14px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
    .col h3 span { opacity: .7; font-family: "Instrument Sans", sans-serif; font-weight: 500; }
    .lead { background: #fff; border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 12px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: .85rem; }
    .lead b { display: block; font-weight: 600; }
    .lead small { color: var(--muted); }
    .tag { display: inline-block; margin-top: 6px; font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 600; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--mint); color: var(--teal-deep); }
    .tag.hot { background: #fde3b0; color: #7a4b00; }

    .runner {
      position: absolute; top: 76px; left: 22px;
      width: calc((100% - 44px - 28px) / 3);
      background: var(--amber); color: var(--ink);
      border-radius: 10px; padding: 10px 12px; font-size: .85rem;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 24px -8px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
      animation: run 9s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    .runner b { display: block; font-weight: 700; }
    @keyframes run {
      0%, 12%   { transform: translateX(0); }
      38%, 55%  { transform: translateX(calc(100% + 14px)); }
      82%, 100% { transform: translateX(calc(200% + 28px)); }
    }

    /* Sections */
    section { padding: 72px 0; }
    .head { max-width: 560px; margin-bottom: 44px; }
    .head h2 { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3.4vw, 2.7rem); line-height: 1.08; font-weight: 700; }
    .head p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.05rem; margin: 14px 0 0; }

    .features { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; column-gap: 56px; }
    .feature { padding: 26px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .feature h3 { font-size: 1.25rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .feature p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); max-width: 44ch; }

    .steps { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 28px; counter-reset: step; }
    .step { counter-increment: step; background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 18px; padding: 28px; }
    .step::before {
      content: counter(step);
      display: grid; place-items: center; width: 38px; height: 38px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--teal); color: #fff; font-family: "Bricolage Grotesque", sans-serif; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 18px;
    }
    .step h3 { font-size: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .step p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); }

    .cta { background: var(--teal); color: #fff; border-radius: 28px; padding: 64px 40px; text-align: center; margin: 24px 0 72px; }
    .cta h2 { font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3.6vw, 2.8rem); font-weight: 700; max-width: 18ch; margin: 0 auto 16px; line-height: 1.08; }
    .cta p { color: var(--mint); margin: 0 auto 30px; max-width: 46ch; }
    .cta .btn-primary { background: var(--amber); color: var(--ink); }
    .cta .btn-primary:hover { background: #ffc24d; }

    footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 28px 0 40px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .92rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-bottom: 56px; }
      .features { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .links a:not(.btn) { display: none; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 520px) {
      .col { min-height: 0; padding: 10px 8px; }
      .lead { padding: 8px; font-size: .78rem; }
      .runner { display: none; }
      .cta { padding: 48px 22px; }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .runner { animation: none; transform: translateX(calc(100% + 14px)); }
      .btn { transition: none; }
      html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <nav>
      <a class="logo" href="/"><i></i><%= locals.brand || 'Leadflow' %></a>
      <div class="links">
        <a href="#features">Features</a>
        <a href="#how">How it works</a>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">Book a demo</a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <header class="hero">
      <div>
        <h1>Turn every enquiry into a booked call.</h1>
        <p>Leads land in one place, reach the right person in seconds, and get a follow-up before they go cold.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">Book a demo</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#how">See how it works</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="board" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="cols">
          <div class="col">
            <h3>New <span>3</span></h3>
            <div class="lead"><b>Priya Sharma</b><small>Northwind Retail</small><br><span class="tag hot">Very urgent</span></div>
            <div class="lead"><b>Daniel Okoye</b><small>Brightside Dental</small><br><span class="tag">Normal</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="col">
            <h3>Contacted <span>2</span></h3>
            <div class="lead"><b>Mei Tanaka</b><small>Harbor Logistics</small><br><span class="tag hot">Urgent</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="col">
            <h3>Booked <span>4</span></h3>
            <div class="lead"><b>Carlos Ruiz</b><small>Verde Studio</small><br><span class="tag">Demo Friday</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="runner"><b>John Carter</b>Test Company</div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <section id="features">
      <div class="head">
        <h2>Everything a lead needs, handled for you.</h2>
        <p>No spreadsheets, no copy-pasting between tools, no enquiry left unanswered over the weekend.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="features">
        <div class="feature"><h3>One inbox for every source</h3><p>Website forms, emails and calls all land in the same list, with the same fields filled in.</p></div>
        <div class="feature"><h3>Sent to the right person</h3><p>Each lead goes to the owner who handles that service and budget, so nothing waits in a shared queue.</p></div>
        <div class="feature"><h3>Urgent leads jump the line</h3><p>A very urgent enquiry alerts your team straight away. A low-priority one waits for the daily digest.</p></div>
        <div class="feature"><h3>Synced to your CRM</h3><p>Every lead is saved to your CRM automatically, with its key stored so records always match.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="how">
      <div class="head">
        <h2>From enquiry to call in three steps.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step"><h3>Capture</h3><p>A visitor sends their details. We check them and save the lead.</p></div>
        <div class="step"><h3>Route</h3><p>The lead is matched to an owner and marked by how urgent it is.</p></div>
        <div class="step"><h3>Follow up</h3><p>A reply goes out the same day, and the next step is on your calendar.</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="cta">
      <h2>Stop losing leads to slow replies.</h2>
      <p>See your own enquiries move through the board in a 20-minute demo.</p>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">Book a demo</a>
    </div>

    <footer>
      <span>© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> <%= locals.brand || 'Leadflow' %></span>
      <span>Lead automation for service businesses</span>
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
